  "transformations": [
    "Camera display swaps channels 0 and 2 to match the publisher visualization and downsamples with Lanczos to 512x320; no frame interpolation. The stored channel encoding is not declared in the HDF5 metadata. Original stored bytes are hashed. Publisher visualization used for display comparison: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NAIL-HNU/EvTTC/main/assets/gif/CCRm.gif",
    "Native event coordinates accumulated by polarity over [timestamp-100000,timestamp); log1p counts scaled by occupied95th percentile for display, then downsampled512x288 and letterboxed.",
